@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+# Frozen CPU log-domain reader candidate
+
+Baseline 7b45d502; only allocation_marginals is replaced through an explicit
+diagnostic adapter. All original files remain byte-identical. Three broad
+final6000 weights and complete6000 checkpoint bindings/hash/actual numerical
+dependencies are checked. No fitting, scientific new samples, or GPU.
+
+For full joint-role log likelihood L and integer frequencies c, solve
+max sum_ij P_ij L_ij - sum_ij P_ij log P_ij, P>=0, P1=1, P^T1=c.
+Entropy coefficient is ONE. With active columns, logP=L+u+v;
+u_i=-LSE_j(L_ij+v_j), v_j=log(c_j)-LSE_i(L_ij+u_i).
+Exact -inf support remains zero. Zero-frequency columns are removed/restored.
+An integral maxflow independently distinguishes infeasible support from
+feasible boundary cases that fail to converge. It supplies no network roles.
+This is NOT exact DP marginals or a graph posterior; satisfying frequencies
+in a soft matrix does NOT constrain the final sampled graph's degrees.
+
+Numerical settings frozen in config.json BEFORE formal paired diagnosis:
+float64, zero initial column potentials, row/column gauge centering,
+row then column updates; at most1000 complete iterations. Row max absolute
+error <=1e-8 and column error/max(1,c) <=1e-8 BOTH required. No fallback,
+epsilon, temperature search, pruning, revised tolerance, or support smoothing.
+Finite probabilities that underflow are separately recorded and rejected,
+not recast as mathematical zero. Extreme centering overflow is a numerical
+range failure. Fixed resource gate2m elements and256MiB estimated workspace.
+
+Reference counterexample: n=2,c=(1,1), diagonal likelihood4/off-diagonal1:
+exact assignment marginal diagonal16/17; entropy scaling diagonal4/5.
+Even perfect row/column sums do not make these equal.
+
+Same-state panel: all11 previous targets, all3 broad models, sample2026102031,
+t=1,8,32,64 =132 input states. Old outputs retain step hashes but not all Xt.
+Replay original deterministic CPU paths solely to recover these inputs;
+all64 state/query/uniform/RNG hashes and old final graph payloads must match.
+Failure stops that worker. These are NOT new independent generation samples.
+Exact full fixed validation first reproduces historical row CE/expected counts
+within2e-8 (record observed error). Paired paths receive identical Xt/target/t/
+full4-block plan, no draw. Save full allocations, LL, role context, p0 and q.
+Report each type/family/target/time/seed; describe max-p0>.01 and MG expected
+shift>1 as descriptive sensitivity levels, NOT post-hoc quality thresholds.
+Any nonconvergence is a recorded missing comparison, never a fallback.
+
+Large reader-only benchmark, after small checks: frozen verified IMDB/PubMed
+types/schema/complete joint roles/prior, T1000, steps20 and500. Original
+reference forward noise generated by frozen seed2026102141, no network.
+Full degree log-PMF uses unchanged original degree_logpmf and a cache restricted
+to ONE current time. No1000-step precomputation. Pre-estimate and probe one
+table, then construct fullLL and scale pertype, under a150s dataset child cap.
+Report partial/timeout honestly. Warm scaling and cached LL lookup separate;
+first degree convolution cost cannot be omitted from full-reader time.
+
+One unique3600s activation starts at first preparation; hard parent cleanup
+and120s reserve for delivery. STOP is cooperative in each bounded computation.
+No new full generation comparison, training, or large graph network. Results
+are suitability evidence, not generation-quality certification. Finish and
+publish, then STOP. Next experiment requires separate authorization.
